### Phase 5 — Zope Security (RBAC) + MySQL (SQLAlchemy + zope.sqlalchemy)
### Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start server first: .\run.bat
### Optional MySQL mode: set DATABASE_URL=mysql+pymysql://root:pass@127.0.0.1:3306/zope_hr?charset=utf8mb4

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Public Health Check (initializes demo users & SQL DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Unauthenticated Request -> 401 E_UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Accept: application/json

### 3. Check Current User (Viewer role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-me
Authorization: Basic viewer:viewer123
Accept: application/json

### 4. Viewer Lists Employees -> 200 OK (Viewer role is allowed to read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Authorization: Basic viewer:viewer123
Accept: application/json

### 5. Viewer Tries to Create Employee -> 403 E_FORBIDDEN!
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Authorization: Basic viewer:viewer123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0007",
  "nameEn": "Blocked User",
  "nameJa": "ブロックテスト",
  "departmentEn": "Sales",
  "departmentJa": "営業部",
  "role": "Staff",
  "email": "blocked@example.co.jp"
}

### 6. HRManager Creates Employee -> 201 Created (writes employees + audit_logs in ONE SQL tx!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Authorization: Basic hr_manager:hr123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0007",
  "nameEn": "Sora Fujimoto",
  "nameJa": "藤本 空",
  "departmentEn": "Engineering",
  "departmentJa": "開発部",
  "role": "Database Engineer",
  "email": "s.fujimoto@example.co.jp"
}

### 7. Two-Phase SQL Transaction Rollback Demo (?simulateError=true -> 500, neither table saved!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?simulateError=true
Authorization: Basic hr_manager:hr123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-9999",
  "nameEn": "SQL Rollback",
  "nameJa": "ロールバック",
  "departmentEn": "QA",
  "departmentJa": "品質保証部",
  "role": "Tester",
  "email": "sqlrb@example.co.jp"
}

### 8. HRManager Reads SQL Audit Logs -> 200 OK (shows EMP-0007 created, NO EMP-9999!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-audit-logs
Authorization: Basic hr_manager:hr123
Accept: application/json

### 9. Viewer Tries to Read Audit Logs -> 403 E_FORBIDDEN!
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-audit-logs
Authorization: Basic viewer:viewer123
Accept: application/json

### 10. HRManager Soft-Deletes EMP-0007 -> 200 OK (updates deleted_flg + writes audit_logs)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0007
Authorization: Basic hr_manager:hr123
Accept: application/json
